    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: blng__RevenueRecognitionRule__c records with blng__CreateRevenueSchedule__c = &apos;No&apos;.
Why it matters: Revenue is not scheduled — it recognizes immediately or never, instead of over the subscription term. Misstates revenue periods, fails audit on multi-period contracts.
Suppress a finding: when the rule legitimately governs immediate-recognition items (perpetual licenses, one-time fees).
Disable the detector: only when immediate-recognition is your standard. Most subscription orgs should leave this on.</value></values>
